<title>USA: Fortune Financial Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Fortune Financial Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>LONGWOOD, Fla. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortune Financial Systems Inc said its net income for the first quarter ended March 31 was $905,837, or $0.07 per share, on revenues of $5,145,940.</p>
<p>This is the company's first quarter as a publicly traded company.</p>
<p>It did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>Fortune Financial is in the business, real estate and entrepreneurial training and consulting industry.</p>
